# FUSEE-CXL testbed hardware bench (g3 only, single-host)
# host=g3 (debian-615-uintr, kernel 6.15)
# CPU: dual-socket 86-core Intel Xeon (NUMA node 0 = 172 total logical, node 1 = CXL)
# CXL: /dev/dax0.0 (devdax mode, 512 GiB, target_node=1 in system-ram mode)
# tool: tests/bench_cxl_dram.c, region=8 GiB per test
# date: 2026-04-24

### DRAM (NUMA node 0, local)
